        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Thomas Robsahm, Margarete Robsahm, Fred Robsahm, Jesse Eisenberg, Gabriel Byrne, Isabelle Huppert, David Strathairn, Amy Ryan, Linda Pedersen, Wenche Foss, Linn Stokke\n- Works: Louder Than Bombs, Begynnelsen på en historie\n- Roles: actor, film director, producer\n- Topics: family relationships, film casts\n\nFacts:\n- Thomas Robsahm was born on 29 April 1964.\n- Thomas Robsahm is an Italian-Norwegian actor, film director, and producer.\n- Margarete Robsahm directed the 1988 Norwegian drama film Begynnelsen på en historie.\n- Begynnelsen på en historie is translated in English as The beginning of a story.\n- Begynnelsen på en historie stars Linda Pedersen, Wenche Foss, and Linn Stokke.\n- Margarete Robsahm is the mother of director Thomas Robsahm.\n- Margarete Robsahm is the sister of actor Fred Robsahm.\n- The film Louder Than Bombs stars Jesse Eisenberg, Gabriel Byrne, Isabelle Huppert, David Strathairn, and Amy Ryan.",
